OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day with sunny     
OL,6,Fspells. The north may be cloudier at   
OL,7,Ftimes with the odd shower possible,    
OL,8,Fwhilst the south stays dry with the    
OL,9,Fbest of the sunny spells. Fresh        
OL,10,Fnortheasterly winds over the Western   
OL,11,FIsles, otherwise light.                
OL,13,CTonight:FThis evening and overnight    
OL,14,Fthe north will be cloudier with a few  
OL,15,Fshowers. Further south will stay dry   
OL,16,Fwith long clear spells. A cold, frosty 
OL,17,Fnight, especially under clearer skies. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
