OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with showers continuing 
OL,6,Fin the north. The south will stay dry  
OL,7,Fwith some longer sunny spells          
OL,8,Fdeveloping. Light winds.               
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly 
OL,11,Fdry Saturday and Sunday with sunny     
OL,12,Fspells and the odd shower possible.    
OL,13,FCold and frosty overnight. Monday may  
OL,14,Fbe cloudier with outbreaks of rain     
OL,15,Fpossible as winds strengthen.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
